  (text "Parts: 1x Arduino Uno, 2x MyoWare 2.0, 1x AD8232 module,"
    (at 15.24 28.448 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.2 1.2))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "9f16b076-7e17-52cc-b9c5-454765131ba2"))
  (text "9x Ag/AgCl snap electrodes (single-use), jumper wires, USB cable."
    (at 15.24 30.353 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.2 1.2))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "eca1744f-0220-5d21-8e64-71a03ba1c59c"))
  (text "No extra components: each sensor board does its own analog filtering;"
    (at 15.24 32.258 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.2 1.2))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "e454017d-83e1-5910-aa4f-979ca1a6059e"))
  (text "the Uno does the digital side (threshold, debounce, bits -> ASCII, heart rate)."
    (at 15.24 34.163 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.2 1.2))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "79b6d860-e2c3-5682-93a0-acd1066ca9b3"))
  (text "WIRING LIST"
    (at 15.24 41.656 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.4 1.4))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "a6168ed7-cbeb-517f-a192-eb75c1ebd545"))
  (text "Sensor pin            ->  Uno pin"
    (at 15.24 45.72 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.1 1.1))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "52a2599d-af62-5b45-a4ba-ab10369f5b3f"))
  (text "MyoWare LEFT  +Vs/GND ->  5V / GND"
    (at 15.24 47.498 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.1 1.1))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "fb930fd0-e3f8-5a89-ac73-74b3815eacf2"))
  (text "MyoWare LEFT  ENV     ->  A0   (left wrist = bit 0)"
    (at 15.24 49.276 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.1 1.1))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "8164b19c-21d5-5910-9ccd-d4c5ffad47af"))
  (text "MyoWare RIGHT +Vs/GND ->  5V / GND"
    (at 15.24 51.054 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.1 1.1))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "09461e24-7ceb-5df7-a877-176c7b6dac0b"))
  (text "MyoWare RIGHT ENV     ->  A1   (right wrist = bit 1)"
    (at 15.24 52.832 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.1 1.1))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "f9e3c21f-e7b9-53d3-ba04-311bb119a66f"))
  (text "AD8232 3.3V / GND     ->  3.3V / GND"
    (at 15.24 54.61 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.1 1.1))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "da3cb56e-e4b8-5133-a177-9858ae1558a1"))
  (text "AD8232 OUTPUT         ->  A2   (heartbeat waveform)"
    (at 15.24 56.388 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.1 1.1))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "3e92cc6c-eb6a-5843-9864-3ff0e11c804a"))
  (text "AD8232 LO+ / LO-      ->  A3 / A4 (lead-off = electrode fell off)"
    (at 15.24 58.166 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.1 1.1))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "72d472e7-e911-5a44-a949-47de3e6b68ff"))
  (text "WHY THE FOREARM, NOT THE WRIST ITSELF"
    (at 15.24 63.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.4 1.4))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "95e5bbe4-d4a4-524d-84e4-bb02b9a3bd33"))
  (text "The muscles that move the wrist up/down live in the forearm;"
    (at 15.24 67.564 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.1 1.1))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "1402bdcc-bcc4-53ba-a33c-46783f6aa4ab"))
  (text "the wrist is mostly tendon and gives a weak, noisy signal."
    (at 15.24 69.342 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.1 1.1))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "11482e27-7cca-54e0-b659-6f379040ec9c"))
  (text "Flexing the wrist down fires the palm-side flexors, so each"
    (at 15.24 71.12 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.1 1.1))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "76388545-bd85-5983-b72b-120c0f29939c"))
  (text "MyoWare sits on the flexors of one arm:"
    (at 15.24 72.898 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.1 1.1))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "f9d7671d-33ae-5c1f-ad0f-00789158b386"))
  (text "  flex LEFT = 0,  flex RIGHT = 1,  flex BOTH = commit letter."
    (at 15.24 74.676 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.1 1.1))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "1825863f-e760-5f85-b2f8-6122507bb42b"))
  (text "ECG electrodes DO go on the wrists (lead I: right vs left arm)."
    (at 15.24 76.454 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.1 1.1))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "5c92ae26-95e3-5de0-a815-f4dda8fbe7a0"))
  (text "PWR_FLAG = KiCad ERC marker only (not a part)."
    (at 15.24 84.836 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1 1))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "194c9fea-6613-55ce-99ad-a48b61523d97"))
  (text "SAFETY: laptop on battery (unplugged from the wall) while electrodes are on a person."
    (at 15.24 265.43 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.3 1.3))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "b6a4eae1-5509-5766-a2b8-ddabe89d1d50"))
  (text "Heart-rate alarm is a warning aid, not a medical device."
    (at 15.24 267.716 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.3 1.3))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "f47bd0c1-82e3-56fe-b735-96873f76b4c8"))
